OL,3,AFour arrested over suspected poisoning
OL,4,Aof elephants in Kenya
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been arrested in Kenya
OL,7,Fas part of an investigation into a
OL,8,Fspate of mysterious elephant deaths
OL,9,Fover the past two months, officials
OL,10,Fhave said.
OL,12,FThree Kenyans and one Tanzanian have
OL,13,Fbeen detained on suspicion of poisoning
OL,14,Fat least 18 elephants in the Amboseli
OL,15,FNational Park, the Kenya Wildlife
OL,16,FService told the BBC.
OL,18,FThe investigation is looking into
OL,19,Fwhether the elephants died from cyanide
OL,20,Fpoisoning after eating large quantities
OL,21,Fof tomatoes sprayed with illegal
OL,22,Fpesticides.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
