OL,3,AFour arrested over suspected poisoning
OL,4,Aof elephants in Kenya
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreliminary laboratory tests have found
OL,7,Ftraces of cyanide in samples of the
OL,8,Fcrops taken from the elephants'
OL,9,Fstomachs.
